  <diagram id="hallucination-verifier-architecture" name="System Architecture (End-to-End)">
    <mxGraphModel dx="2600" dy="1600" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="2600" pageHeight="1480" background="#F8FAFC" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <mxCell id="HEADER" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 18px; font-weight: bold; color: #0F172A; line-height: 1.3;&quot;&gt;System Architecture: Reducing Hallucination in Healthcare via Agentic AI &amp;amp; Verification&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 12px; color: #475569; margin-top: 4px;&quot;&gt;A Comparative Evaluation of LLM-as-Judge (Gemini Flash) vs Local NLI (DeBERTa-v3) &amp;amp; Lexical Baselines across Synthetic Benchmark (Exp 1) &amp;amp; Realistic Healthcare RAG (Exp 2)&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#CBD5E1;strokeWidth=1.5;align=left;spacingLeft=25;shadow=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="20" width="1600" height="75" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="LEGEND" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 11px; font-weight: bold; color: #1E293B; margin-bottom: 2px;&quot;&gt;ARCHITECTURE LEGEND&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;display: flex; gap: 12px; font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;display: inline-block; padding: 2px 6px; background: #ECFDF5; border: 1.5px solid #10B981; border-radius: 4px; color: #065F46; font-weight: 600;&quot;&gt;■ Solid: Built / Active&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&quot;display: inline-block; padding: 2px 6px; background: #FEF2F2; border: 1.5px dashed #EF4444; border-radius: 4px; color: #991B1B; font-weight: 600;&quot;&gt;- - Dotted: Planned / Later Phase&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&quot;display: inline-block; padding: 2px 6px; background: #FFF7ED; border: 1px solid #EA580C; border-radius: 4px; color: #C2410C;&quot;&gt;⚡ Groq API&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&quot;display: inline-block; padding: 2px 6px; background: #EFF6FF; border: 1px solid #2563EB; border-radius: 4px; color: #1D4ED8;&quot;&gt;☁ Gemini API&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&quot;display: inline-block; padding: 2px 6px; background: #F3E8FF; border: 1px solid #9333EA; border-radius: 4px; color: #6B21A8;&quot;&gt;💻 Local CPU&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#CBD5E1;strokeWidth=1.5;align=left;spacingLeft=15;shadow=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1660" y="20" width="880" height="75" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="L1_BG" value="LAYER 1: DATA SOURCES &amp; INGESTION" style="swimlane;startSize=36;rounded=1;arcSize=3;fontColor=#0F172A;fillColor=#EFF6FF;strokeColor=#3B82F6;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;align=center;collapsible=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="110" width="460" height="1340" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="L2_BG" value="LAYER 2: EXPERIMENT DATA PREP &amp; RAG GENERATION" style="swimlane;startSize=36;rounded=1;arcSize=3;fontColor=#0F172A;fillColor=#FFFBEB;strokeColor=#F59E0B;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;align=center;collapsible=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="530" y="110" width="480" height="1340" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="L3_BG" value="LAYER 3: VERIFICATION LAYER (SHARED MULTI-VERIFIER)" style="swimlane;startSize=36;rounded=1;arcSize=3;fontColor=#0F172A;fillColor=#F0FDF4;strokeColor=#10B981;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;align=center;collapsible=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1040" y="110" width="490" height="1340" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="L4_BG" value="LAYER 4: EVALUATION, STATISTICS &amp; PROFILING" style="swimlane;startSize=36;rounded=1;arcSize=3;fontColor=#0F172A;fillColor=#FAF5FF;strokeColor=#8B5CF6;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;align=center;collapsible=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1560" y="110" width="480" height="1340" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="L5_BG" value="LAYER 5: PRESENTATION, WEB &amp; DISSEMINATION" style="swimlane;startSize=36;rounded=1;arcSize=3;fontColor=#0F172A;fillColor=#FFF1F2;strokeColor=#F43F5E;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;align=center;collapsible=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="2070" y="110" width="470" height="1340" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="L1_MEDHALLU" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-weight: bold; color: #1E3A8A; font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;HuggingFace: MedHallu (pqa_labeled)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 10px; color: #2563EB; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 4px;&quot;&gt;DATA SOURCE | HF: UTAustin-AIHealth/MedHallu&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 10.5px; color: #334155;&quot;&gt;• Pinned Commit: &lt;b&gt;51506045...&lt;/b&gt; (Rule R4.4)&lt;br/&gt;• 500 clinical QA pairs derived from PubMed abstracts&lt;br/&gt;• Synthetic hallucinations injected at sentence level&lt;br/&gt;• Schema: Question, Knowledge, Ground Truth, Hallucinated Answer, Difficulty, Category&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#3B82F6;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#0F172A;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=12;shadow=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="60" y="165" width="420" height="125" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="L1_PUBMEDQA" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-weight: bold; color: #1E3A8A; font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;HuggingFace: PubMedQA (pqa_labeled)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 10px; color: #2563EB; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 4px;&quot;&gt;CORPUS SOURCE | HF: qiaojin/PubMedQA&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 10.5px; color: #334155;&quot;&gt;• Pinned Commit: &lt;b&gt;9001f285...&lt;/b&gt; (Rule R4.4)&lt;br/&gt;• ~1,000 real PubMed biomedical research abstracts&lt;br/&gt;• Unmodified medical literature serving as the retrieval corpus for Experiment 2 RAG&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#3B82F6;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#0F172A;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=12;shadow=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="60" y="310" width="420" height="115" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="L1_PILOT" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-weight: bold; color: #1E3A8A; font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;Pilot Inspection &amp;amp; Spot-Check&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 10px; color: #1D4ED8; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 4px;&quot;&gt;PHASE 1 | src/pilot_checks.py&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 10.5px; color: #334155;&quot;&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Risk 1:&lt;/b&gt; Human spotcheck (n=50) uncovered &lt;b&gt;46.0%&lt;/b&gt; unsupported ground-truth answers in MedHallu&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Risk 2:&lt;/b&gt; Lexical shortcut test on 100 dev pairs yielded ROUGE-L AUROC = &lt;b&gt;0.4894&lt;/b&gt; (&amp;lt; 0.95 rule pass)&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#EFF6FF;strokeColor=#2563EB;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#0F172A;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=12;shadow=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="60" y="445" width="420" height="125" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="L1_GATE_G1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-weight: bold; color: #B45309; font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;Gate G1 Decision: Plan 2 Activation&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 10px; color: #D97706; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 4px;&quot;&gt;DECISION GATE | Human Sign-off&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 10.5px; color: #334155;&quot;&gt;• High unsupported rate (&amp;gt; 10%) triggered protocol fallback to &lt;b&gt;Plan 2&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Experiment 2 (RAG):&lt;/b&gt; Upgraded to Primary Headline Study (200 pairs)&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Experiment 1 (MedHallu):&lt;/b&gt; Retained as Secondary Benchmark&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FEF3C7;strokeColor=#D97706;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#0F172A;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=12;shadow=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="60" y="590" width="420" height="130" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="L1_CACHE" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-weight: bold; color: #0F172A; font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;Cache &amp;amp; Provenance Infrastructure&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 10px; color: #475569; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 4px;&quot;&gt;PERSISTENCE | data/cache/ &amp;amp; manifests&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 10.5px; color: #334155;&quot;&gt;• &lt;b&gt;JsonlCache:&lt;/b&gt; Deterministic hashing &amp;amp; offline storage of API responses&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;FROZEN.json:&lt;/b&gt; Pinned prompt hashes (generator_v1, judge_v1)&lt;br/&gt;• SHA-256 manifests tracking data, configs, and seeds (seed=42)&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F1F5F9;strokeColor=#64748B;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#0F172A;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=12;shadow=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="60" y="740" width="420" height="120" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="L2_E1_PAIRS" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-weight: bold; color: #9A3412; font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;Exp 1 Pair Generator (src/build_exp1_pairs.py)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 10px; color: #EA580C; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 4px;&quot;&gt;PHASE 2 | BENCHMARK DATASET GENERATION&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 10.5px; color: #334155;&quot;&gt;• Samples 250 questions from MedHallu, stratified by clinical difficulty&lt;br/&gt;• Expands to 500 balanced (context, answer) evaluation pairs:&lt;br/&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;- 250 Ground Truth (Supported, Label 0)&lt;br/&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;- 250 Hallucinated Answer (Hallucinated, Label 1)&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#EA580C;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#0F172A;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=12;shadow=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="550" y="165" width="440" height="125" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="L2_E1_SPLIT" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-weight: bold; color: #9A3412; font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;Question-Level Stratified Splitter&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 10px; color: #EA580C; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 4px;&quot;&gt;SPLIT ENGINE | 0 QUESTION LEAKAGE&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 10.5px; color: #334155;&quot;&gt;• Splits strictly by question (both GT &amp;amp; Hallucinated stay together):&lt;br/&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;→ &lt;b&gt;Dev Set:&lt;/b&gt; 50 questions / 100 pairs (for threshold tuning)&lt;br/&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;→ &lt;b&gt;Test Set:&lt;/b&gt; 200 questions / 400 pairs (for evaluation)&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFF7ED;strokeColor=#EA580C;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#0F172A;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=12;shadow=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="550" y="310" width="440" height="105" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="L2_E1_FILES" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-weight: bold; color: #9A3412; font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;Exp 1 Dev &amp;amp; Test Stores&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 10px; color: #EA580C; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 4px;&quot;&gt;STORAGE | data/exp1/dev.jsonl &amp;amp; test.jsonl&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 10.5px; color: #334155;&quot;&gt;• Immutable JSONL test partitions with verified 50/50 balance&lt;br/&gt;• Test questions explicitly excluded from Experiment 2 selection&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#F97316;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#0F172A;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=12;shadow=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="550" y="435" width="440" height="85" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="L2_E2_CHUNK" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-weight: bold; color: #9A3412; font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;PubMedQA Abstract Chunker (src/build_index.py)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 10px; color: #D97706; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 4px;&quot;&gt;PHASE 4 | RETRIEVAL INDEX PREPARATION&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 10.5px; color: #334155;&quot;&gt;• Chunks 1,000 PubMedQA abstracts into ~250 token segments (30 overlap)&lt;br/&gt;• Generated 1,790 clean chunks tracking source document metadata&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFBEB;strokeColor=#D97706;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#0F172A;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=12;shadow=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="550" y="540" width="440" height="95" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="L2_E2_FAISS" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-weight: bold; color: #9A3412; font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;Local Embedding &amp;amp; FAISS Vector Index&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 10px; color: #B45309; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 4px;&quot;&gt;💻 TOOL: Local CPU | Model: BAAI/bge-small-en-v1.5 | faiss-cpu&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 10.5px; color: #334155;&quot;&gt;• 384-dimensional normalized dense vectors embedded locally&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;FAISS IndexFlatIP:&lt;/b&gt; Exact inner-product cosine similarity retrieval&lt;br/&gt;• Highly efficient: &lt;b&gt;451.8 MB peak RAM&lt;/b&gt; footprint on laptop CPU&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FEF3C7;strokeColor=#D97706;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#0F172A;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=12;shadow=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="550" y="655" width="440" height="115" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="L2_E2_RETRIEVAL" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-weight: bold; color: #9A3412; font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;Dual-Condition Retrieval Engine&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 10px; color: #EA580C; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 4px;&quot;&gt;RETRIEVAL | 100 Normal + 100 Degraded&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 10.5px; color: #334155;&quot;&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Normal Condition (n=100):&lt;/b&gt; Top-3 nearest chunks retrieved (100% hit)&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Degraded Condition (n=100):&lt;/b&gt; Retrieve top-20, drop source document chunks, retain top-3 distractors to induce realistic hallucinations&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFF7ED;strokeColor=#EA580C;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#0F172A;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=12;shadow=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="550" y="790" width="440" height="115" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="L2_E2_GROQ" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-weight: bold; color: #9A3412; font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;RAG Generator: Groq Cloud API&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 10px; color: #C2410C; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 4px;&quot;&gt;⚡ TOOL: Groq API | Model: qwen/qwen3.8-27b | temp=0&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 10.5px; color: #334155;&quot;&gt;• Generates clinical answers conditioned on retrieved context chunks&lt;br/&gt;• Prompt: generator_v1 (frozen in FROZEN.json) | max_tokens=256&lt;br/&gt;• Outputs 200 answers stored in data/exp2_rag/generated.jsonl&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFEDD5;strokeColor=#C2410C;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#0F172A;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=12;shadow=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="550" y="925" width="440" height="115" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="L2_E2_ANN_EXPORT" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-weight: bold; color: #9A3412; font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;Annotation Preparation (src/annotation.py)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 10px; color: #D97706; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 4px;&quot;&gt;PHASE 6 | RFC 4180 CSV SHEETS&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 10.5px; color: #334155;&quot;&gt;• Generates clean RFC 4180 CSV annotation sheets with seed=42 shuffle&lt;br/&gt;• Exports: annotator_1.csv, annotator_2.csv, template.csv, guide&lt;br/&gt;• Degraded/normal conditions completely blinded to annotators&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFBEB;strokeColor=#D97706;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#0F172A;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=12;shadow=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="550" y="1060" width="440" height="105" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="L2_E2_GATE_G2" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-weight: bold; color: #B91C1C; font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;[PLANNED] Gate G2: Human Annotation &amp;amp; Adjudication&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 10px; color: #DC2626; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 4px;&quot;&gt;STATUS: IN PROGRESS / BLOCKED | DOTTED BOX&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 10.5px; color: #450A0A;&quot;&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Independent Human Labeling (Rule R1.5):&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Annotator 1: Muhammad Saad | Annotator 2: Rabia Qaiser (200 pairs)&lt;br/&gt;• Inter-annotator agreement: Cohen&#x27;s Kappa κ computation&lt;br/&gt;• Adjudication of disagreements → labeled.csv → pairs.jsonl ground truth&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FEF2F2;strokeColor=#DC2626;strokeWidth=2;dashed=1;dashPattern=6 4;fontColor=#7F1D1D;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=12;shadow=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="550" y="1185" width="440" height="130" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="L3_COORDINATOR" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-weight: bold; color: #065F46; font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;Shared Verifier Coordinator (src/run_verifiers.py)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 10px; color: #059669; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 4px;&quot;&gt;SHARED PIPELINE | filters/base.py&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 10.5px; color: #334155;&quot;&gt;• Abstract BaseVerifier interface establishing unified JSONL schema&lt;br/&gt;• Evaluates Exp 1 and Exp 2 pairs with identical verification code&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ECFDF5;strokeColor=#10B981;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#0F172A;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=12;shadow=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1065" y="165" width="440" height="95" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="L3_TUNING" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-weight: bold; color: #065F46; font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;Threshold Optimizer (src/tune_thresholds.py)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 10px; color: #047857; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 4px;&quot;&gt;PHASE 3 | TUNED ON EXP 1 DEV (100 PAIRS)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 10.5px; color: #334155;&quot;&gt;• Grid-searches optimal classification thresholds maximizing F1&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Frozen in results/thresholds.json:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;- ROUGE-L threshold = &lt;b&gt;0.1741&lt;/b&gt; (Dev F1 = 0.6667)&lt;br/&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;- Filter B threshold = &lt;b&gt;0.0039&lt;/b&gt; (Dev F1 = 0.6667)&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#D1FAE5;strokeColor=#059669;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#0F172A;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=12;shadow=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1065" y="280" width="440" height="125" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="L3_ROUGE" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-weight: bold; color: #334155; font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;Baseline Filter: ROUGE-L Precision&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 10px; color: #475569; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 4px;&quot;&gt;💻 TOOL: Local CPU | Library: rouge-score&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 10.5px; color: #334155;&quot;&gt;• Measures longest common subsequence precision: answer vs context&lt;br/&gt;• Rule: score &amp;lt; 0.1741 → Hallucinated (1), else Supported (0)&lt;br/&gt;• Ultra-fast lexical baseline: &lt;b&gt;median latency 2.5 ms&lt;/b&gt; on CPU&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F1F5F9;strokeColor=#64748B;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#0F172A;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=12;shadow=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1065" y="425" width="440" height="115" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="L3_FILTER_B" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-weight: bold; color: #581C87; font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;Filter B: Local NLI Cross-Encoder&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 10px; color: #7E22CE; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 4px;&quot;&gt;💻 TOOL: PyTorch CPU | Model: cross-encoder/nli-deberta-v3-small&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 10.5px; color: #334155;&quot;&gt;• Sentence Splitter: &lt;b&gt;pysbd&lt;/b&gt; (biomedical rule-based segmentation)&lt;br/&gt;• Sentence × Chunk entailment probability matrix (max 512 tokens)&lt;br/&gt;• Formula: &lt;i&gt;score = min&lt;sub&gt;s&lt;/sub&gt;(max&lt;sub&gt;c&lt;/sub&gt;(P(entailment)))&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br/&gt;• Rule: score &amp;lt; 0.0039 → Hallucinated (1) | 6 CPU threads, batch=16&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F3E8FF;strokeColor=#9333EA;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#0F172A;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=12;shadow=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
